<p>Donums HR Global (“Donums”, “we”, “our”) respects your privacy and takes the protection of personal information seriously. This policy explains what information we collect through our website and platform, why we collect it, and how we protect it.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Service requests and enquiries:</strong> your name, contact details, organisation details, location and the message you send.</li><li><strong>Accounts:</strong> name, email address, password hash, and optional profile details.</li><li><strong>Recruitment and HR support:</strong> CVs, cover letters, screening answers, references and related records where applicable.</li><li><strong>Learning:</strong> course access, progress, quiz results and certificates.</li><li><strong>Technical information:</strong> IP address, device details and basic security data used to protect the platform from abuse.</li></ul>
<h2>How we use information</h2>
<p>We use personal data to deliver the service requested, manage your account, assess enquiries, support hiring and payroll processes, maintain compliance, protect the platform and communicate important updates.</p>
<h2>Who can access your information</h2>
<p>Only authorised Donums staff and approved partners who need the information to support the service are permitted access. We do not sell personal data or use it for unrelated marketing purposes.</p>
<h2>Data retention and security</h2>
<p>We keep personal information only for as long as required for the service, legal obligations or legitimate business use. Uploads such as CVs and payment proofs are stored in a protected environment with restricted access and security controls.</p>
